From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:49:53 +0000
Subject: fix(android): retain pending contentOffset until the content range is
 ready

KRRecyclerView dropped a deferred setContentOffset when a layout retry
re-deferred it, so a list could land at the wrong offset (the "bounces to
bottom" symptom). The pending command is now an opaque owner retained
across layouts until the range is long enough, and every replacement or
cancellation path (smooth scroll, a11y, nested/generic motion, custom
animations) goes through explicit owner helpers. Adds a Robolectric test.

Fork-Patch: android-list-pending-content-offset
Origin: botiverse/KuiklyUI#118 dee8264ebd5f6911415f7e136cce6a9130b9dc79
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

